  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Assist&#xEA;ncia Humanit&#xE1;ria de Emerg&#xEA;ncia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Humanitarian Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">O objectivo &#xE9; responder &#xE0;s necessidades das popula&#xE7;&#xF5;es afectadas por conflitos na prov&#xED;ncia de Cabo Delgado atrav&#xE9;s de interven&#xE7;&#xF5;es que salvam vidas e sustentam para construir a resili&#xEA;ncia das comunidades. O n&#xFA;mero total de benefici&#xE1;rios que ser&#xE3;o apoiados ao abrigo deste pr&#xE9;mio &#xE9; de 36.283 indiv&#xED;duos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to respond to the conflict-affected populations needs in the cabo delgado province through live-saving and sustaining interventions to build communities resilience.The total number of beneficiaries that will be supported under this award is 36,283 individuals.</narrative>
  </description>
